{"word":"ἔννοια","uri":"ennoia","senses":[{"word":"ἔννοια","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἔννοια,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">ας</span>\n(<span class=\"grec\">ἡ</span>)\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> l’acte de penser,\nexercice de la pensée, <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">657</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> conception, notion,\nintelligence, <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Phil.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">59</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span> ; <span class=\"grec\">χρόνου,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Tim.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">47</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span>, la conception du\ntemps : <span class=\"grec\">ἔννοιαν λαϐεῖν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Phæd.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">73</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>, se former une notion\n(dans l’esprit) <span class=\"ital\">p. opp. à</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἐπιστήμην ἔχειν</span> ; <span class=\"grec\">εἰς ἔννοιαν\nἔρχεσθαί τινος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 57, 4,</span> en arriver à concevoir qqe ch. ;\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. d’un mot,</span> signification\n<span class=\"ital\">ou</span> sens, <span class=\"aut\">DC.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">69, 21</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> réflexion, pensée, idée,\n<span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">3, 1, 13 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">M.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">585</span><span class=\"refpb\">f</span>, <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἔννοιαν λαϐεῖν\nτινος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Hipp.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1